# A3 step 6 T33-0 "Fakten + Schatten" (design ws-10/cli-grp/a3-schritt6/DESIGN-T33-TREFFPUNKT-20261109.md v1.1 + Nachtrag 1;
# owner decisions F1-F17 = (a), no T33-3, O6 (a): no hidden hop, no teleport). MEASUREMENT ONLY, no behaviour change.
# AiPlayerbot.BotGroups.Manager.Gather (0 = off, default; 1 all, 2 cohort B, 3 cohort A; needs Manager.Types > 0). Pins:
#   (a) the switch: member default 0, read with default 0, an unknown value and Types 0 each turn it off with one error line,
#       echoed in its sorted place (between BotGroups.Manager and .StatusSeconds), documented = 0 right after Manager.Types;
#   (b) the bot side: PostManagerStatus reads its own place (ManagerFacts ReadPlace, no registry, no other player) only behind
#       the existing gate AND Gather != 0 AND its own edge's group, and posts one GatherPlace with every status and on a
#       map/instance change, after the roster scope test; Gather 0 leaves the edge post byte-identical (due or changed);
#       GatherPlace is appended to Kind (the existing kinds keep their values);
#   (c) the manager side: the one manager clock (AdvanceClock) moves before DrainInbox; RunGather runs after the directive pass
#       and is a no-op at Gather 0 (place table cleared, shadow Off, return before anything else); a GatherPlace is stored only
#       while Gather is on; the place table is dropped with the other tables;
#   (d) the shadow: pure headers (no game header, no config, no log), the registry read through a const view only, the T33
#       arrival rule only in ArrivedForGroup (group_mgr::Arrived, S7's rule), the virtual deadline on the manager clock and not
#       in a resumed pass, T30's wall-clock rendezvous_timeout counted as expired only past the virtual deadline less T30's
#       whole second (kT30SecondSlackMs; else t30_cut), also for a group the directive pass ended and swept in one pass (the
#       engine's swept list, read only), no place_jump from a stale previous place, both leader snapshots fresh, the fixed
#       minute3 field list, the event=phase and event=shadow_end lines;
#   (d2) T33-0b (design v1.2 7, 2.1, F2 (a)): manager ADHOC groups get no meeting, only anchor counters: AnchorPass (no line
#       sink, an ending group not judged) calls ArrivedAtAnchor once (the formation anchor, the leader's instance only on an
#       instanceable map, no z, nobody judged = not all there), a group gone while never all at its anchor is adhoc_never,
#       Off forgets the anchors, the adhoc_* fields last in minute3;
#   (e) T33-1 is absent: no Update verb sender, no b15, no MaskRendezvous/NextRung/ReanchorDue, no new caller of NextFallback,
#       the ack reasons 19/20 unused; no movement, teleport or action in the manager, facts or shadow files; supervisor::Post(
#       and ->Tick( keep their counts;
#   (f) the unit test is registered and runs every test group.
# Pure rules: t/group_gather_policy_tests.cpp. Every check_* returns "" when it holds, else the reason; the negative probes at
# the end reuse them on mutated text.
if(NOT DEFINED PB_SOURCE_DIR)
